            "review_title": "Review at Menya Hanabi Hcm",
            "review_text": "Happiness57827317604\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat Lunch Spot in District 1 — Mazesoba and Ramen Both Hit the Spot\nSep 2026 • Business\nI came here for lunch with a coworker. It's a very convenient location, within walking distance of the office district in District 1.\nThis was my first time trying mazesoba, and the Japanese owner plated it so carefully that it raised my expectations before I'd even taken a bite. The flavor was incredibly rich and the portion was generous — thoroughly satisfying. Finishing it off by mixing in rice at the end was delicious too.\nMy coworker and I also shared a ramen, and honestly, it might be the best ramen I've had in Ho Chi Minh City. I went with the shoyu ramen. I'd love to recommend it to friends, and I'll definitely be back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 8, 2026",
