            "review_title": "Review at Menya Hanabi Hcm",
            "review_text": "Tori Goe\nChiba Prefecture, Japan47 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Japanese Ramen & Mazesoba in Ho Chi Minh City\nJul 2026 • Friends\nHanabi is a great place for anyone looking for authentic Japanese food in Ho Chi Minh City, especially ramen and mazesoba.\n\nThe restaurant is particularly famous for its mazesoba, a Japanese-style soupless noodle dish. The thick noodles are mixed with minced meat, egg yolk, green onions, garlic, and a rich savory sauce. The flavor is bold and satisfying, and mixing all the ingredients together makes every bite delicious.\n\nTheir ramen is also worth trying, with a rich and flavorful soup and noodles that have a nice texture. Beyond ramen and mazesoba, Menya Hanabi offers a good selection of Japanese dishes, making it a nice choice whether you come for a quick meal or want to enjoy Japanese food with friends.\n\nThe atmosphere feels casual and authentically Japanese, and the food quality is consistently good.\n\nIf you are searching for Japanese ramen, mazesoba, or authentic Japanese cuisine in Ho Chi Minh City, Menya Hanabi is definitely worth a visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 24, 2026",
